## ?? Deployment Instructions

### Local Testing:
```bash
# Build
./build.sh  # or build-web.bat on Windows

# Test
npm install -g http-server
http-server dist/

# Visit
open http://localhost:8080
```

### Production Deployment:
```bash
# Build
./build.sh

# Verify
ls dist/pages/*.html  # Check all pages

# Deploy
scp -r dist/ user@server:/var/www/meengle/
# or
aws s3 sync dist/ s3://meengle-bucket/
```

